00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:19,000
 Now, this actually brings an entirely new threat model to our frameworks as a whole

82
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:24,000
 if they start implementing and becoming 2.1 spec compliant

83
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:27,000
